{{!
    @template format_dari/chatbox_loading

    The "the tutor is composing an answer" turn in Ask Dari conversation. Rendered
    client-side by format_dari/chatbox while a question is in flight and removed again when
    the answer (or an error) arrives.

    The animated dots are purely decorative and are hidden from assistive technology; the
    role="status" text carries the same information to screen-reader users and is also shown.
    The message list itself is switched to aria-busy="true" for the duration.

    Classes required for JS:
    * dari-ai-loading - marks this turn as the transient loading state.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * thinkinglabel string The status text, e.g. "Thinking…".

    Example context (json):
    {
        "thinkinglabel": "Thinking…"
    }
}}
<div class="dari-ai-message dari-ai-message-bot dari-ai-loading" id="dari-ai-loading"><span class="dari-ai-avatar dari-ai-avatar-pulse" aria-hidden="true"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="round" width="16" height="16"><path d="M10.5 3.5c.5 4.1 2.9 6.5 7 7-4.1.5-6.5 2.9-7 7-.5-4.1-2.9-6.5-7-7 4.1-.5 6.5-2.9 7-7z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><path d="M18.25 14.25c.2 1.6.9 2.3 2.5 2.5-1.6.2-2.3.9-2.5 2.5-.2-1.6-.9-2.3-2.5-2.5 1.6-.2 2.3-.9 2.5-2.5z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" fill-opacity=".6"/></svg></span><div class="dari-ai-message-body"><div class="dari-ai-message-content"><span class="dari-ai-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span><span class="dari-ai-thinking" role="status">{{thinkinglabel}}</span></div></div></div>
